{"ref":"BDB, קִרְיַת אַרְבַּע","hw":"קִרְיַת אַרְבַּע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיַת אַרְבַּע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> older name of Hebron; πόλις Αρβο(κ), Καρ(ι)αθαρβοκ, etc. <strong>(</strong>prob. = <em>fourfold city</em> (otherwise <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:15\" href=\"/Joshua.14.15\">Jos 14:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:13\" href=\"/Joshua.15.13\">15:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:11\" href=\"/Joshua.21.11\">21:11</a>), v. especially GFM<strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:15\" href=\"/Joshua.14.15\">Jos 14:15</a> (JED), <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:10\" href=\"/Judges.1.10\">Ju 1:10b</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ק׳ אַרְבַּ֑ע)</span>, also <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:2\" href=\"/Genesis.23.2\">Gn 23:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:13\" href=\"/Joshua.15.13\">Jos 15:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:54\" href=\"/Joshua.15.54\">54</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:7\" href=\"/Joshua.20.7\">20:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:11\" href=\"/Joshua.21.11\">21:11</a> (all P); <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:27\" href=\"/Genesis.35.27\">Gn 35:27</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.25\">Ne 11:25</a>.—Vid. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חֶבְרוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_חֶבְרוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">חֶבְרוֹן</a>.","next":"BDB, קִרְיַת בַּעַל","prev":"BDB, קִרְיָתַ֫יִם"}